<title>UK: TLG wins contracts worth 19 million stg.</title>
<headline>TLG wins contracts worth 19 million stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British light fitting group TLG Plc said on Tuesday it was awarded a total of about 19 million stg of new airfield lighting contracts in the Far East and Egypt.</p>
<p>These deals included a 16.1 million stg contract from the Hong Kong Airport Authority for a system for the second runway at the new airport at Chek Lap Kok. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
